WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.771
Install GoNuts using the current first-run
screens. We will download the mod, choose limits,
and

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:07.153
review before starting.

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:14.965
Use Minecraft Java Edition 26.2 with Fabric
Loader, Fabric API for 26.2, and Java 25. In the

00:00:14.965 --> 00:00:21.769
official launcher, follow Fabric’s installer
instructions. Other launchers use their own Fabric

00:00:21.769 --> 00:00:26.711
installation flow. The written guide links the
official instructions.

00:00:27.917 --> 00:00:34.706
Open gonuts dot at and choose Download for
Minecraft 26.2. Save the GoNuts jar file. Do not

00:00:34.706 --> 00:00:39.929
extract it. You do not need a manual API key for
normal keyless setup.

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:47.153
Close Minecraft. Open the game folder for the
installation you actually launch. Put the GoNuts

00:00:47.153 --> 00:00:53.202
jar and matching Fabric API jar in its mods
folder. Create mods if it is missing. Keep only
one

00:00:53.202 --> 00:00:59.252
GoNuts jar. Custom launcher instances may use a
different folder from the default dot minecraft

00:00:59.252 --> 00:00:59.698
folder.

00:01:00.917 --> 00:01:07.259
Launch your Fabric 26.2 installation and join
DonutSMP. Enable the sidebar scoreboard in the

00:01:07.259 --> 00:01:13.876
server’s settings so GoNuts can read your balance.
Press B. A new install opens guided setup. If

00:01:13.876 --> 00:01:16.978
you see the Dashboard, choose Set up trading.

00:01:18.208 --> 00:01:24.360
On Choose your limits, enter maximum per trade and
maximum session spend. Choose amounts you

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:30.377
intend to use; the values shown here are examples,
not recommendations. Swarm is optional.

00:01:30.377 --> 00:01:36.194
Select Review and continue. This moves to the
review screen; it does not start trading.

00:01:37.417 --> 00:01:43.433
Use Review protections to understand the Evasion
settings. Review Staff Watch separately if you

00:01:43.433 --> 00:01:48.817
use it. Return to setup afterward. Joining Swarm
and configuring Discord are optional

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:54.263
connections, not required installation steps.
Opening a tutorial never starts trading.

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:01.115
On Review and Start, check your amounts and
readiness. Start trading saves these fixed limits

00:02:01.115 --> 00:02:06.729
and starts continuous buying and listing through
the existing checks. This offline preview is

00:02:06.729 --> 00:02:12.223
blocked because it has not joined a server. On
your client, read the actual blocker; do not

00:02:12.223 --> 00:02:17.838
bypass it. Choose Start trading only when ready.
Server rules prohibit automation; running it

00:02:17.838 --> 00:02:18.985
carries a ban risk.

00:02:20.208 --> 00:02:26.220
Trade is the current name for AutoPilot. B opens
GoNuts, and End is the default emergency stop.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:32.169
Check Minecraft Controls if you changed the
bindings. A fresh database may need time to gather

00:02:32.169 --> 00:02:37.738
market data. Purchases and profit are not
guaranteed. Use Tutorials or the written guide

00:02:37.738 --> 00:02:39.194
whenever you need help.
